        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Per-job ingestion traces\n\nEach ingestion job emits a **distributed trace** to the **Tempo** datasource:\n\n- **Root span** = one span per ingestion job.\n- **Child spans** = one span per pipeline stage (typedetect, atomization, semantic-cell, embedding, graph-write, index).\n\nUse these traces to see exactly *where* an individual job spent its time and which stage failed — complementary to the aggregate p95 stage-duration panel above.\n\n### How to explore\n\n1. Open **Explore** (compass icon) and select the **Tempo** datasource.\n2. Set the query type to **Search**.\n3. Filter by **Service Name** = `pneuma-server`.\n4. Optionally add span filters (e.g. `status = error`) to jump straight to failed jobs.\n5. Click a trace to view the span waterfall.\n\nOr use the **TraceQL** query `{ resource.service.name = \"pneuma-server\" }` in the panel to the right."
